cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Apiary Spring Risk: late spring frost risk for Swiss apiaries"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Allen
    given-names: Ayla
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Guin-Kiwi/apiary-spring-risk"
abstract: >-
  Analyses the risk of late spring frosts (April to June) for Swiss cantonal
  apiaries from historical MeteoSwiss temperature data and cantonal hive
  counts, and publishes the results as a static, interactive report.
keywords:
  - beekeeping
  - apiary
  - spring frost
  - climate risk
  - Switzerland
